  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "1. Overtime is commonly paid at **time-and-a-half**.\n2. Therefore, the overtime multiplier is **1.5×**.\n3. At Mark’s former rate, that would be \\(11 \\times 1.5 = \\$16.50\\) per hour.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1.5\\times}\n\\]",
    "The overtime multiplier remains **1.5×**. With Mark’s corrected base rate:\n\n\\[\n10 \\times 1.5 = \\$15\n\\]\n\nSo Mark’s overtime pay is **$15 per hour**, and the multiplier is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1.5\\times}\n\\]",
